# Move the end effector relative to its current pose.
#
# The delta is expressed in `frame_id`:
#   ""            -> planning frame (default: base_link)
#   <ee link>     -> tool frame, e.g. "front" moves along the gripper axes
#   any TF frame  -> axes of that frame
# Rotation is applied about the end-effector origin, around the axes of `frame_id`.

# Goal
float64 dx          # [m]
float64 dy          # [m]
float64 dz          # [m]
float64 droll       # [rad]
float64 dpitch      # [rad]
float64 dyaw        # [rad]
string frame_id
float64 velocity_scaling    # 0 -> server default
---
# Result
bool success
string message
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped target_pose
---
# Feedback
string state
